Civilian quote, surrender and named-NPC oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16.
See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA). In Tactical/Civ_Quotes.cc, BeginCivQuote asks OracleCivQuoteHeadless (defined in Oracle.cc) after the
text lookup: while a civilian probe runs it records the quote, entry and text length, remembers the civilian for the surrender
callback and opens no box; otherwise it returns false and the box opens as before. Appends wrappers around the static
SurrenderMessageBoxCallBack and DetermineCivQuoteEntry. In TacticalAI/DecideAction.cc the surrender condition of
DecideActionBlack moves unchanged into the static OfferSurrenderNow, and wrappers expose it and the static DecideActionNamedNPC.
Tactical/Overhead.cc gains accessors for gfPauseAllAI and guiPauseAllAITimer. No behaviour change. Applied by
tools/oracle/build.sh after 0017.

